          "_comment": "Registers this SDK's bundled English map into base_sdk's BundledTranslations registry at boot (lms_sdk's 'af' hook is the precedent). base_sdk bundles no 'en' map because English normally survives through the humanized-key fallback, but that only holds for keys named after their copy: reset_password_text humanized to the literal \"Reset password text\" on every app shell's reset-password sheet, because demo builds take their served map from comms_sdk's MockSettingsRepository (a handful of rows that never carried this key). Backend-served translation rows still win; the map is only the offline/unseeded fallback consulted before the humanized-key fallback. Imports are declared explicitly (src paths, like lms_sdk) because neither symbol is exported by the auth_sdk barrel every composed main.dart already imports. Requires a base_sdk with bundled_translations.dart (the bundled-af wave)."
